ices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"人真多呀， 热热闹闹的真好啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"这些怎么样啊~？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"啊哈哈哈哈！！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"冲啊冲啊冲啊冲啊！！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"还不够还不够~！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"火力全开~！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"不用这么客气！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"怎么样，爽吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"诶，这是给我的吗？为什么？ 唔。我这个人比较笨，所以搞不明白…… 不过，只要拼尽全力就可以了吧！啊哈哈哈！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"热火朝天地开始吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"火力可是！！非常充足的！！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"哟~呜呜哇~！！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"呀嚯~！想让我把哪里推倒？ 还是想让我在哪里挖坑？尽管开口吧~！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"喔喔~！！什么情况！感觉浑身上下充满了力量！？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"多谢你的支援~！我要更加努力了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"这些我当然是举双手欢迎啦！好开心！老师，谢谢你！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"你就拭目以待吧！我会加油的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"所以，我要在这里做什么呢？给你暖暖身子？还是说……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？没有开发温泉的时候， 我都在做什么？嗯……我都在做什么来着？ 啊！我在找温泉开发！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我最讨厌东西纠缠到一起了。还是快刀斩乱麻， 从头开始更方便！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"肚子饿了？那给你煮杯泡面啊？诶？没有工具……那就用这个吧~♪","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"你问能不能调整火力？能吧？应该。 虽然我没试过！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"噢，老师！欢迎回来~ 今天要做些什么呢？温泉开发怎么样？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，我正等你呢！ 有什么事你尽管说！我马上就去做！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊~！果然是老师！ 我正等你呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师很忙吗？ 不好意思啊！ 但我这边也很急！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊啊~确实是这样…… 不过，这眼温泉可不会一直涌出温泉水哦？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"应该，只剩下几个小时了！ 我希望老师能在温泉干涸之前赶到这里！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"……诶？是哦？ 这就是我一个人做的哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"别看我这样，我可是温泉开发部的！ 再说了，对于需要热水的人我可不能视而不见。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"更重要的是…… 这可是和老师有关呀！嘿嘿！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"快快快！不要再客气了， 快进来吧！现在温度刚刚好呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"这是惠特别准备的， 老师专属温泉哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"呃……嗯？什么情况？我不太懂……这是什么情况？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"和老师在一起好开心！……嗯？理由？为什么呢？我从来没想过。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"有什么需要我帮忙的吗？没什么……就是，突然很想帮老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"好奇怪啊。我平时也不怕热……但只要和老师在一起，我都会觉得有些热呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"对！今天是我的生日！ 你问我想要什么生日礼物……？比如…… 可以推倒的什么东西？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"祝你生日快乐，老师！ 今天真是一个火热的日子呀！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春快乐！ 新的一年一定会和天惠神力 喷出的火焰一样红红火火的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"外面有很多穿着奇装异服的孩子呢……难道今天可以从风纪委员会手里逃过一劫？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"虽然我是个什么都不懂的笨蛋， 但泡在温泉里看月亮，想想就很舒服！ 好！老师！现在就来和我开发温泉吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐~！今年请赐予我更多的工作…… 比如拆除障碍物和挖掘土地之类的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"是今天吧？给好孩子送礼物的节日。真好！我会收到什么礼物呢？ 已经开始期待了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"嗯——早知道就多带些过来了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"呃，怎么会变成这样……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_tactic_defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"已经拿到拆除许可了？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_tactic_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"要清理的东西好多啊！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_tactic_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"啊？这就结束了？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_tactic_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"啊~好爽~！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_tactic_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive～♪","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/cn/ch0088_title.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0088_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/ch0088_battle_shout_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/original/ch0088_battle_shout_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0088_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%8B%E4%BB%93%20%E6%83%A0/origin